                "text": "In honor of Men's Health Week, I hosted a Congressional Men\u2019s Health Briefing with my Co-Chair, Rep. Wesley Hunt (@RepWPH).  Too many men struggle to get the physical and mental health assistance they need.  We can change that with more awareness of men\u2019s health issues https://t.co/IYNfbyS13z",
