                "text": "Too often, men skip routine health screenings and turn minor issues into major ones.  \nToday, I introduced the Men\u2019s Health Awareness and Improvement Act to establish an Office of Men\u2019s Health that will create and support programs to focus on men's health nationwide https://t.co/gPn6xlPbts",
