                "text": "One year ago today, the Supreme Court overturned Roe v. Wade and denied women the federal right to make their own reproductive health choices.  We must reinstate these rights immediately.  Women should have the right to make their health choices, not state legislatures. https://t.co/Wpiqr44HuU",
